## Why This Is Asked

Tests practical decision-making for edge/cloud routing and privacy in a beginner context.

## Key Concepts

- Edge inference
- Simple policy
- PII detection
- Latency testing

## Code Example

```javascript
function routePrompt(p) {
  const isSmall = p.tokens <= 128;
  const hasPII = /PII_REGEX/.test(p.text);
  if (isSmall && !hasPII) return edgeInfer(p);
  return cloudInfer(p);
}
```

## Follow-up Questions

- How would you adapt the policy for offline mode changes?
- What metrics would you log to monitor privacy and latency?

